H55-H3K6","c":[]},{"h":"Rated Capacity: 3KVA/3KW","c":[]},{"h":"Battery Capacity: 6*12V/9Ah","c":[]},{"h":"Input Voltage: 208/220/230/240VAC","c":[]},{"h":"Battery Type: Lead Acid Battery","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Specification","active":true,"cls":"tab-1","noExpand":false,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Description","active":false,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <h3>The Must EH55-H3K6 3KVA <a href=\"/ups-and-ips/online-ups\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Online UPS</a> is a powerful and reliable double-conversion UPS engineered to deliver uninterrupted, clean, and stable power to mission-critical systems. With its true online pure sine wave output, this UPS guarantees maximum protection for high-sensitivity equipment such as servers, workstations, medical devices, data centers, telecom systems, and enterprise networking hardware.</h3><p><br></p><p>Equipped with advanced double-conversion technology, the Must EH55-H3K6 ensures zero transfer time, preventing voltage drops or fluctuations from affecting your equipment. Its wide input voltage range (110V–300V) and intelligent DSP control system make it ideal for environments with unstable power.</p><p><br></p><p>This model features a high-capacity battery pack designed to deliver dependable backup performance for demanding loads. The LCD display provides real-time status, making it easy to monitor voltage, battery health, and operational mode. Built with durability and efficiency in mind, the 3KVA online UPS is an excellent choice for professional and enterprise settings.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>3KVA / 3KW Double-Conversion Online UPS</li><li>Pure Sine Wave Output for maximum equipment protection</li><li>Zero Transfer Time during power failure</li><li>Wide Input Voltage Range: 110V – 300V</li><li>High-capacity built-in or external battery support</li><li>High efficiency with stable, regulated output</li><li>Perfect for servers, enterprise networking, storage, and IT systems</li><li>LCD Display for easy real-time monitoring</li><li>Intelligent protections: overload, short circuit, surge, over-temperature</li><li>Sturdy, long-lasting build for business environments</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"KSTAR HP SERIES 3KVA ONLINE UPS (WITH 8PCS BATTERY, STANDARD BACKUP, FOR PC AND NETWORKING DEVICE ONLY)","href":"/kstar-hp-series-3kva-online-ups-with-8pcs-battery-standard-backup-for-pc-and-networking-device-only","now":"38,000৳","old":"39,100৳","single":""},{"name":"Must EH55-H3KRS 3KVA Online UPS","href":"/must-eh55-h3krs-3kva-online-ups","now":"40,000৳","old":"42,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Must EH55-H1K3 1KVA Online UPS","href":"/must-eh55-h1k3-1kva-online-ups","now":"21,500৳","old":"24,000৳","single":""},{"name":"APC Smart 1000VA online UPS","href":"/apc-smart-1000va-online-ups","now":"23,000৳","old":"25,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Must EH55-H3K8 3KVA Online UPS","href":"/must-eh55-h3k8-3kva-online-ups","now":"39,300৳","old":"40,200৳","single":""},{"name":"Must EH55-H1KS 1KVA Online UPS","href":"/must-eh55-h1ks-1kva-online-ups","now":"29,000৳","old":"31,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Must EH55-H3KR 3KVA Online UPS","href":"/must-eh55-h3kr-3kva-online-ups","now":"44,000৳","old":"4,500৳","single":""},{"name":"Marsriva MR-US6K Energy Efficient 6kVA Online UPS","href":"/marsriva-mr-us6k-energy-efficient-6kva-online-ups","now":"105,000৳","old":"108,500৳","single":""},{"name":"MARSRIVA MR-US3K - Energy Efficient 3KVA ONLINE UPS","href":"/marsriva-mr-us3k-energy-efficient-3kva-online-ups","now":"","old":"","single":"48,000৳"},{"name":"Marsiva MR-US1K Energy Efficient 1kVA Online UPS","href":"/marsiva-mr-us1k-energy-efficient-1kva-online-ups","now":"","old":"","single":"24,500৳"}]},{"title":"Video","active":false,"cls":"tab-5","noExpand":true,"kind":"empty"},{